		(title "CEC PCIe 8-pin 3-Port Module")
		(date "2026-07-02")
		(rev "BETA-2")
		(company "CEC")
		(comment 1 "Thin parent (round-4 hierarchical conversion, Rev BETA-2) -- sheet-symbol fan-out/fan-in only, no components")
		(comment 2 "Leaf sheets: 01-hub-link, 02-can, 03-ldo, 04-mcu, 05-sensing, 06-cable-power, 07-usb-flash")
		(comment 3 "GND/+3V3/+5VSB are global power nets (per-leaf symbols); every other crossing is a real drawn sheet-pin lane carrying its exact flat-schematic net name (lane_labels)")
		(comment 4 "Rev BETA-2 (spec Sec 2.8 v1.4.0 output-architecture revision, owner-ratified 2026-07-04): J_OUT1, J_OUT2, J_OUT3 DELETED from 06-cable-power -- replaced by Keystone 3586 blade clips (TB<cable><n>, LCSC C238113), CLIP_COUNTS['pcie-8pin-3port']=(2, 2) per cable, each landing on the SAME post-shunt rail/GND net its share of J_OUT used to carry. Sense-return contacts NOT added (owner decision box (e) still open). See docs/standard-tier-review/output-daughterboard-study-2026-07-04.md and blade-fit-check-2026-07-04.md.")
	)
